Package: biowrenchR
Title: Data Structure Pipelines for Genomic Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Hung", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "matthew.hung@crick.ac.uk")
Description: Helpers for genomic file formatting (GMT, GCT), list/data-frame
    conversion, human-mouse gene symbol mapping via Ensembl BioMart, gene-set
    filtering, isoform summarization, annotation joins, sample sex imputation,
    Crick Institute sample-sheet / FASTQ templates, and plotting utilities
    (palettes, PDF export, facet strip colors).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/hungms/BiowrenchR
BugReports: https://github.com/hungms/BiowrenchR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    biomaRt,
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    grDevices,
    rlang,
    stats,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    utils
Suggests:
